# Walkthrough - Dynamic Materials Service

I have replaced the hardcoded subject and material data in [materials-service.tsx](file:///c:/Users/User/Documents/monorepo-new/apps/home/modules/services/ui/views/materials-service.tsx) with dynamic data fetched via tRPC, mirroring the logic found in the `question-bank` service.

## Changes Made

### [api]

#### [services.ts](file:///c:/Users/User/Documents/monorepo-new/packages/api/src/routers/home/services.ts)
- Added `getMaterials` endpoint to `serviceRouter` which fetches subjects with nested chapters and topics.

### [home]

#### [materials-service.tsx](file:///c:/Users/User/Documents/monorepo-new/apps/home/modules/services/ui/views/materials-service.tsx)
- Integrated `useTRPC` and `trpc.home.service.getMaterials.useQuery()`.
- Replaced the static `materialSections` with a dynamic version that uses the fetched `subjects`.
- Mapped database `chapters` to the UI's `materials` list within each subject card.
- Added a loading state with a spinner and placeholder animation.
- Ensured dynamic icon and color assignment using existing utility functions.

